    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68377" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολυβδ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολύβδαινα</span>
			, <i>leaden weight</i> or <i>sink</i> of a net. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ὥστε δίκτυον κατέσπασεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					840
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				519b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				8p.432M.
			</span></i>; <i>piece of lead,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.1627.322
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>leaden ball</i> or <i>slingbullet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				3.3.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cael.</u>
				289a25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				27.11.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>plummet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				159
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>weight</i> of seven minae, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
